 ('unsupported','Does any explicit requirement exceed this version?', ['none','one_time_date','temporary_duration','daily_cap','multiple_windows','app_exceptions','other','unclear'], 'Unsupported requirements stop the whole proposal. A valid weekly part does not justify dropping a one-time or daily-cap clause.', 'Always'),
 ('list_scope','How are lists specified?', ['named_lists','all_saved_lists','all_saved_except_named','no_list_specified','ambiguous'], 'All saved lists is not all installed apps. Snapshot the saved lists used for review; do not invent an all-apps list.', 'Always'),
 ('list_<id>','For this particular saved list, is it a target of the requested block?', ['include','exclude','not_mentioned','ambiguous'], 'Ask once per saved list using its stable ID and name. Interpret negation and the full sentence. Multiple include answers are allowed. Duplicate names require a user choice.', 'One question per saved list'),
