 ('usage_status','Is the allowed usage duration explicit and unambiguous?', ['explicit','missing','ambiguous','not_applicable'], 'Usage is time spent using selected apps, not elapsed time until a block. “30 minutes a day” is a daily cap, not a repeating cycle.', 'Always; use only for usage'),
