 ('Exact usage cycle','Allow 40 minutes on Scrollers, then block it for 50 minutes.', 'Review',['Scrollers'],'usage_cycle','Use 40 min → block 50 min → repeat',{'usage_status':'explicit','usage_hours':'0','usage_minutes':'40','lockout_status':'explicit','lockout_hours':'0','lockout_minutes':'50'}, 'Review discloses repeating cycles and midnight reset. Actual usage requires native picker tokens; typed domains alone cannot count usage.'),
