 ('NFC','Block Games whenever I scan my tag.', 'Review',['Games'],'nfc_tag','Toggle with your registered NFC tag',{'intent':'nfc_tag','start_status':'not_applicable','usage_status':'not_applicable'}, 'Resolve tag registration locally. Do not ask the model for a tag ID or silently enable manual blocking.'),
 ('Unknown list','Block Shopping weekdays from 9am to 5pm.', 'Create list', ['Shopping (missing)'],'weekly_schedule','Create Shopping, then return to the draft',{'unknown_list':'yes','list_social':'not_mentioned','list_games':'not_mentioned','list_scrollers':'not_mentioned'}, 'Jev cannot generate “Shopping.” An exact local span or user-entered name supplies it. The user selects apps in Apple’s picker.'),
 ('Ambiguous names','Block Social weekdays from 9am to 5pm. (Saved: Social media and Social work)', 'Clarify',['Social media or Social work'],'weekly_schedule','Which Social list?',{'list_social':'ambiguous','list_social_work':'ambiguous','unknown_list':'ambiguous'}, 'A model can be confident and still choose the wrong similarly named list. Ask the user to select a saved list; do not clone it.'),
