 ('App-level exception','Block everything except Messages during work.', 'Unsupported',[],'unclear','Cannot infer an all-apps selection',{'unsupported':'app_exceptions'}, 'Saved-list matching cannot implement arbitrary app exceptions. “During work” also needs concrete days and times.'),
 ('Missing AM/PM','Block Games weekdays from 9 to 11.', 'Clarify',['Games'],'weekly_schedule','9am–11am, 9pm–11pm, or another window?',{'start_status':'ambiguous','end_status':'ambiguous'}, 'Do not guess a business-hours default. Ask targeted time controls; preserve the user’s original wording.'),
