 ('Split window','Block Scrollers weekdays 9am–noon and 1pm–5pm.', 'Unsupported',['Scrollers'],'weekly_schedule','Two windows need separate blocks',{'unsupported':'multiple_windows'}, 'Do not bridge the lunch gap or silently discard the second window.'),
